      "text": "Hey Graves.  I'm not gonna tell you how to live your life cause lord knows you don't wanna hear it\u2026",
      "duration": 5.486
    },
    {
      "order": 2,
      "character": "Graves",
      "audioFile": "necro_match_start_necro_inferno_convo03_02",
      "audioUrl": "audio/necro_match_start_necro_inferno_convo03_02.mp3",
      "text": "But.",
      "duration": 0.883
    },
    {
      "order": 3,
      "character": "Infernus",
      "audioFile": "inferno_match_start_necro_inferno_convo03_03",
      "audioUrl": "audio/inferno_match_start_necro_inferno_convo03_03.mp3",
      "text": "If you ever find yourself over your head you can talk to me for help.",
      "duration": 3.865
    },
    {
      "order": 4,
      "character": "Graves",
      "audioFile": "necro_match_start_necro_inferno_convo03_04",
      "audioUrl": "audio/necro_match_start_necro_inferno_convo03_04.mp3",
      "text": "We close now?",
      "duration": 1.252
    },
    {
      "order": 5,
      "character": "Infernus",
      "audioFile": "inferno_match_start_necro_inferno_convo03_05",
      "audioUrl": "audio/inferno_match_start_necro_inferno_convo03_05.mp3",
      "text": "Look when I was around your age I needed help and someone gave it to me.  It changed my life, and I just wanted you to know that I'm willing to pay it forward.",
      "duration": 10.333
    },
    {
      "order": 6,
